The AC201 ZigBee Split AC Control converts control commands sent using a ZigBee signal into IR (Infra-Red) signal to control your AC system. It allows you to control the system mode, temperature, fan speed and ventilation of the air conditioner remotely from the mobile app.

## Key Features

- Converts the home automation gateway's ZigBee signal into IR commands
- Pre-installed IR codes for mainstream split air conditioners
- Pairing: full IR code scan, brand scan, or manual IR code input
- Temperature measurement
- Switchable power plugs for US, AU, EU, UK
- 120° IR angle coverage
